   "title": "Example 1: Find 1⁄4 of 12.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "12\n\nTo find one quarter we need to split our amount into 4 equal parts.\n\n12 ÷ 4 = 3\n\n3\n\n3\n\n3\n\n3\n\nEach part is worth 3, so 1⁄4 of 12 = 3",
