   "title": "Example 3: Find 3⁄4 of 28.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "28\n\nWe start by splitting 28 into 4 equal parts.\n\n28 ÷ 4 = 7\n\n7\n\n7\n\n7\n\n7\n\nEach quarter is worth 7. We want 3⁄4\n\n7\n\n7\n\n7\n\n7\n\nWe need to calculate 3 × 7.  \n3 × 7 = 21  \n3⁄4 of 28 = 21",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
