   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 4: Find 2⁄5 of 40.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "40\n\nWe start by splitting 40 into 5 equal parts.\n\n40 ÷ 5 = 8\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\nEach fifth is worth 8. We want 2⁄5\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\n8\n\nWe need to calculate 2 × 8.  \n2 × 8 = 16  \n2⁄5 of 40 = 16",
